      "id": 486572,
      "username": "ahsantareen",
      "name": "Ahsan Tareen",
      "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:41:50.060Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/pararera\">@Pararera</a></p>\n<p>This can be achieved if you do not allow those users for particular doctypes at all But only those documents having field X set to Value Y can be shared one by one with particular user by working with <strong>Share With</strong> option within Side Bar where you can also control user to either write, read and other actions he can perform with subject document only.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/8/e8e139f1525eb9816af604175e7285bdeb9b6184.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/e8e139f1525eb9816af604175e7285bdeb9b6184\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/8/e8e139f1525eb9816af604175e7285bdeb9b6184_2_690x309.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"xe9jJJtOhBswtSoJ4dWPqfadeAY\" width=\"690\" height=\"309\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/8/e8e139f1525eb9816af604175e7285bdeb9b6184_2_690x309.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/8/e8e139f1525eb9816af604175e7285bdeb9b6184_2_1035x463.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/8/e8e139f1525eb9816af604175e7285bdeb9b6184_2_1380x618.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"848381\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1918×860 99.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
