      "created_at": "2025-11-16T04:07:56.172Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You could also use a <code>has_permission</code> hook to filter everything at a system level if you’d like.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://docs.frappe.io/framework/user/en/python-api/hooks#document-permissions\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"/files/framework%20(1).png\" class=\"site-icon\" alt=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/framework/user/en/python-api/hooks#document-permissions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">docs.frappe.io</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    \n\n<h3><a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/framework/user/en/python-api/hooks#document-permissions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hooks</a></h3>\n\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
